From: VERHILLE Arnaud <gist974@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:48:37 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/17] Re-arm catchpoints after a reset

reset() clears the state flags and Debugger::reset() sets CHECK_BP and
CHECK_WP again for the guards that exist, but not CHECK_CP: a catchpoint set
before a reset was no longer checked afterwards.
---
 Moira/MoiraDebugger.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Moira/MoiraDebugger.cpp b/Moira/MoiraDebugger.cpp
index 1927d5c..cef25ce 100644
--- a/Moira/MoiraDebugger.cpp
+++ b/Moira/MoiraDebugger.cpp
@@ -247,6 +247,7 @@ Debugger::reset()
 {
     breakpoints.setNeedsCheck(breakpoints.elements() != 0);
     watchpoints.setNeedsCheck(watchpoints.elements() != 0);
+    catchpoints.setNeedsCheck(catchpoints.elements() != 0);
 }
 
 void
